        "424e0472-4e7c-4aa5-82c5-4d6c64d661a2": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 288,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Manual steps\n\nA recipient has to complete (sign) a document; the API cannot do that. While the flow runs (10 minutes):\n\n1. In PandaDoc create a document (any template or PDF) with yourself as a signer and at least one signature field.\n2. Send it and open it from the email (or the document's signing link).\n3. Sign and finish the document.\n\nThe trigger then emits the recipient_completed event and the flow passes."
        }
